            "display_arrows": false,
            "display_dots": true,
            "author_1": "Jessica M[stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/download_18.jpg",
            "text_1": "<p><br/>“I’ve tried several microneedling products before, but this one feels much more professional and easy to use. My skin texture looks smoother after just a few weeks.”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_2": "Amanda R. [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/download_17.jpg",
            "text_2": "<p><br/>“The cartridges arrived sealed and high quality. I’ve been using the Dr. Pen device consistently and noticed visible improvement in acne scars and fine lines.”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_3": "Nicole T [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/download_24.jpg",
            "text_3": "<p><br/>“Super fast shipping and excellent customer support. The derma roller feels sturdy and works great with my hair care routine.”<br/><br/></p>",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 24
          }
        },
        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Know more about Derma Roller",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Know more about Derma Roller<br/><br/>A derma roller is a handheld skincare tool featuring hundreds of tiny needles that create micro-channels in the skin. This process, called microneedling, stimulates your skin's natural healing response and boosts collagen production. The result is improved texture, reduced appearance of fine lines, and enhanced absorption of skincare products.<br/><br/>Our 540-pin derma roller with 0.5mm needles is designed for at-home use and gentle enough for regular application. It works best when used 1-2 times per week as part of your skincare routine. Always apply to clean skin and follow with your favorite serums or moisturizers for maximum benefits.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
