            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Derma rollers create micro-channels in the skin that stimulate collagen production and improve product absorption. This process helps reduce the appearance of fine lines, scars, and uneven texture while promoting a brighter, more youthful complexion. Regular use can enhance skin firmness and overall radiance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4PMemf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Stimulates collagen production and promotes skin renewal for a more youthful appearance. Reduces the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and acne scars through micro-needling technology. Improves skin texture and firmness while enhancing the absorption of serums and skincare products. Minimizes pores and evens out skin tone for a smoother, more radiant complexion. Safe and effective for all skin types with minimal downtime.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NB7rmQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Specifications",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Derma Roller Specifications<br/><br/>Needle Count: 540 titanium needles<br/>Needle Length: 0.5mm<br/>Roller Head Diameter: 10mm<br/>Handle Material: Stainless steel<br/>Sterilization: Medical-grade<br/>Recommended Use: 2-3 times per week<br/>Storage: Keep in sterile container when not in use</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_pLXieh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Start with clean, dry skin. Hold the derma roller at a 45-degree angle and gently roll over your face in upward motions—avoid the delicate eye area. Use light to medium pressure; do not press hard. Roll horizontally, vertically, and diagonally across each section of your face for 1-2 minutes total. Use once or twice weekly to allow skin recovery time between sessions. Follow with your favorite serum or moisturizer to enhance absorption. For best results, maintain consistency and be patient—visible improvements typically appear after 4-6 weeks of regular use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CBGCN7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Precautions",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Before using this derma roller, please read the following precautions carefully:<br/><br/>Do not use if you have active acne, open wounds, severe sunburn, or any skin infections. Avoid use on areas with eczema, psoriasis, or other inflammatory skin conditions. If you are pregnant or nursing, consult your healthcare provider before use.<br/><br/>Stop using immediately if you experience excessive redness, bleeding, or irritation. Do not share your derma roller with others. Always sanitize the roller with rubbing alcohol before and after each use. Allow the roller to air dry completely before storage.<br/><br/>If you are taking blood thinners or have a bleeding disorder, consult your doctor first. Avoid sun exposure for at least 24 hours after treatment. Do not use this product if you are allergic to any of its materials.<br/><br/>If irritation persists or worsens, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist. Keep out of reach of children.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
